  "Wings of Passion <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Deal Elec damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, then inflict [Devastation]: Decrease DEF by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> + $4 for every $3 points of {{A}}'s SPD, up to <color=#FFFC40>$5</color>, and increase DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$6</color> + $8 for every $7 points of {{A}}'s SPD, up to <color=#FFFC40>$9</color>. Lasts for $10 turns.\\nIf Kumi Katayama has [Super Limit], increase <link=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by $11.\\nUnlock [Secret Art: Lightning Legs].\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The electric blade sweeps across, sparks flying everywhere, carrying wanton madness and undeniable force, piercing through all enemies' bodies, dealing Electric damage.</color></size></b>": "",
  "<size=23>Thunderous Judgement Lv.$1</size>": "",
  "<size=23>Thunderous Judgement <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Deal Elec damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, if skill dealt damage, ignore all affinities and decrease Down Points by $2, then inflict [Devastation]: Decrease DEF by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> + $5 for every $4 points of {{A}}'s SPD, up to <color=#FFFC40>$6</color>, and increase DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> + $9 for every $8 points of {{A}}'s SPD, up to <color=#FFFC40>$10</color>. Lasts for $11 turn.\\nIf Kumi Katayama has [Super Limit], decrease target's Down Points by $12 and inflict [Break]: Increase Downed DMG Taken by $14 for every $13 points of {{A}}'s SPD, up to <color=#FFFC40>$15</color>, and increase DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$16</color> + $18 for every $17 points of {{A}}'s SPD, up to <color=#FFFC40>$19</color>. Lasts for $20 turn.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Lightning strikes down, the ground trembles, it roars like a shout, shattering all bodies that attempt to resist, dealing fatal Electric damage.</color></size></b>": "",
