  "Deal Elec damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, if skill dealt damage, ignore all affinities and decrease target's Down Points by $2, then inflict [Break]: Increase Downed DMG Taken by $4 for every $3 points of {{A}}'s SPD, up to <color=#FFFC40>$5</color>, and increase DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$6</color> + $8 for every $7 points of {{A}}'s SPD, up to <color=#FFFC40>$9</color>. Lasts for $10 turn\\nIf this skill knocks down any target, grant Kumi Katayama [Super Limit] for $11 turns.\\n[Super Limit]: Evolve the next [Wings of Passion] and [Thunderous Judgement].\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The Lightning Legs sweep, accompanied by lightning and impact, causing enemies to fall to the ground instantly, the peerless presence intimidating the entire battlefield.</color></size></b>": "",
