  "D<color=#000000>e</color>mon Unleashed": "",
  "r:\"^Deal Electric damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack, and inflict Hard Knocks for (\\d+) turns\\. When in Lightning Legs state, also increase this skill's damage by (\\d+)%\\.\\nAlso, Secret Technique: Lightning Legs can be used (\\d+) time\\.\\nHard Knocks: Decrease Defense by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> \\(for every (\\d+) points of Speed, increase by ([\\d\\.]+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\)\\. Also, increase damage taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> \\(for every (\\d+) points of Speed, increase by ([\\d\\.]+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\)\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Shift into high gear, unleashing Electric damage on all enemies\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Deal Electric damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack\\. Decrease Down Points of all targets that take damage by (\\d+) regardless of Electric affinity, and inflict Hard Knocks for (\\d+) turn\\. When in Lightning Legs state, decrease Down Points of all targets that take damage by (\\d+) more and inflict Detention for (\\d+) turn\\.\\nHard Knocks: Decrease Defense by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> \\(for every (\\d+) points of Katayama's Speed, increase by ([\\d\\.]+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\)\\. Also, increase damage taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> \\(for every (\\d+) points of Katayama's Speed, increase by ([\\d\\.]+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\)\\.\\nDetention: Increase damage taken while knocked down by ([\\d\\.]+)% for every (\\d+) points of Katayama's Speed \\(up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\)\\. Also, increase damage taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> \\(for every (\\d+) points of Katayama's Speed, increase by ([\\d\\.]+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\)\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Unquenchabe rage rains down like thunder, dealing Electric damage to all enemies\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Deal Electric damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack\\. When targets take damage, decrease Down Points by (\\d+) regardless of Electric affinity, and inflict Detention for (\\d+) turn\\.\\nWhen this skill knocks down any target, gain Lightning Legs for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nDetention: Increase damage taken while knocked down by ([\\d\\.]+)% for every (\\d+) points of Katayama's Speed \\(up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\)\\. Also, increase damage taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> \\(for every (\\d+) points of Speed, increase by ([\\d\\.]+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\)\\.\\nLightning Legs: Enhance the skill effects of the next Discharge Sprocket or Thunderbolt Outrage used\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Let loose a supercharged kick to deal Electric damage to all enemies\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Highlight：Deal Electric damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack, and (\\d+)% chance to inflict <link\\=\\\"s\\|107\\\"><u>Dizzy</u></link> on foes for (\\d+) turn\\. Also, permanently decrease the target's Defense by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> \\(this effect does not stack\\)\\. Also, increase damage taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Electric damage to 1 foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to 1 foe\\.\\nRanged Attack：Deal Gun damage to 1 foe\\. Can fire until out of ammo\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^When an ally attacks a knocked down foe, increase Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^During battle, when Katayama's Speed is above (\\d+), increase Attack by (\\d+) for every (\\d+) point of Speed above \\d+ \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\)\\.$\"": "",
  "When Katayama uses Discharge Sprocket, Secret Technique: Lightning Legs is unlocked and becomes usable 1 time.\\nWhen Secret Technique: Lightning Legs deals damage, greatly decrease the target's Down Points regardless of Electric affinity. Also, increase the Defense decrease effect of Hard Knocks by 10% for 2 turns (for every 10 points of Speed, increase by 2.22% more, up to a maximum bonus of 40%).": "",
  "When Katayama knocks down a foe, permanently decrease the target's Down Point maximum by 1.\\nWhen a target is inflicted with Detention, increase critical damage taken by 30% more for 1 turn.\\nWhen Katayama deals Electric damage, inflict <link\\=\"s|104\"><u>Shock</u></link> on the target.": "",
  "When Katayama knocks down a foe with a skill, increase the target's damage taken while downed by 10% more for 1 turn. Also, permanently increase party's Attack by 10% (stacks up to 3 times).": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Discharge Sprocket and Thunderbolt Outrage by 3.": "",
  "Highlight Enhanced: After activating a Highlight, the next time Katayama knocks down a foe, permanently increase the target's damage taken by 20% more. This effect does not stack.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Secret Technique: Lightning Legs and Thief Tactics by 3.": "",
  "At the start of battle, gain 2 Wings of Guidance stacks. Gain 1 Wings of Guidance stack after every 2 skills used. Wings of Guidance stacks up to 3 times.\\nAt the start of Katayama's turn, spend 1 Wings of Guidance stack to gain the following buffs for 1 turn. Increase Katayama's Attack by 50%, critical rate by 10%, critical damage by 30%, and allow her Highlight to activate critical hits. Also, increase damage taken by foes with Hard Knocks by 30% more, and increase damage taken by downed foes with Detention by 20% more.\\nWhen Katayama takes fatal damage, if she has Wings of Guidance, spend 1 Wings of Guidance stack to evade that damage (this effect activates once per battle, and is not effective against certain skills).": "",
