  "r:\"^Elec dmg to all foes \\(([\\d\\.]+)% Atk\\)\\. When targets take dmg, decrease Down Points by (\\d+) ignoring Elec affinity, and inflict Hard Knocks \\((\\d+) turn\\)\\. When in Lightning Legs state, decrease Down Points by (\\d+), and inflict Detention \\((\\d+) turn\\)\\.\\nHard Knocks: Decrease Def ([\\d\\.]+)% \\+ ([\\d\\.]+)% per (\\d+) Speed \\(max bonus ([\\d\\.]+)%\\)\\. Also, increase dmg taken ([\\d\\.]+)% \\+ ([\\d\\.]+)% per (\\d+) Speed \\(max bonus ([\\d\\.]+)%\\)\\.\\nDetention: Increase dmg taken while knocked down ([\\d\\.]+)% per (\\d+) Speed \\(max ([\\d\\.]+)%\\)\\. Also, increase dmg taken ([\\d\\.]+)% \\+ ([\\d\\.]+)% per (\\d+) Speed \\(max bonus ([\\d\\.]+)%\\)\\.$\"": "",
